# Used by `make sandbox-image-sdk` (Docker reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# Allow-list: the build context is the repository root, so send only what the Dockerfile copies.
# This also keeps .env, .venv and the rest of the repository out of the build.
*
!packages/sdk/src/agentbuilder
!packages/sdk-nat/src/agentbuilder_nat
!packages/sdk-nat/src/nemo_fabric_adapters
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
